            <div xml:id="m-59c04404-b09d-4630-8e5d-f43000c536b9">
              <lg xml:id="m-ec38fc11-2850-4c65-b2dd-5f6f2b9fdf39">
                <l xml:id="m-0bdb47dc-b0d9-4d16-beeb-023f95071018" facs="#m-4a4347ed-2863-438a-bf74-894eb9a851c8" label="text-like">Sunday within the Octave of the Sacred Heart. 98</l><l xml:id="m-306b2352-8c9b-4048-8195-df6666626204" facs="#m-1a8766c5-acf3-41ac-8c76-cd30f69701c6" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-0b969c77-607b-4517-b21c-86d21eabae55" facs="#m-6d4862cf-6e4d-4c8f-a1f5-fa39580272fd" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of the second Vespers of the Feast, p. 977.</l><l xml:id="m-49187f3b-00ca-4827-b4fa-8ac70fcdd769" facs="#m-9b3827fa-1dd8-4678-a23a-5304d6dfa724" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-3b4df4e0-e0c3-4890-ae12-8f8579c0705c" facs="#m-5d68424d-71f0-4d45-8733-f10c7dbcc1e6" label="ambiguous">r. Petr. 5.</l><l xml:id="m-2dc6e8ac-1b06-41f6-8635-be40a6074a49" facs="#m-6d7a78fb-b8aa-461e-a49f-66160bfdf055" label="lyrics-like">vAríssimi: Humiliámini sub po-] sollicitúdinem vestram proiiciéntes</l><l xml:id="m-8d621242-f8e2-462f-83ee-07c9227035de" facs="#m-0db13b7c-c9ce-4aa2-9ddb-8ad82e44ed1a" label="lyrics-like">A ténti manu Dei, ut vos exáitet lin eum, * quóniam ipsi cura est de</l><l xml:id="m-a01ef1d7-b3a9-42e3-8890-0139de0cd598" facs="#m-524cd66a-dcf1-4cba-a1ec-75f648c5f75f" label="lyrics-like">in témpore visitatiónis; t omnem l vobis.</l><l xml:id="m-097b25ca-9c90-4ade-942b-9a00b11775b1" facs="#m-9a8cd616-3c6b-4c70-b8b8-8905d98e3d55" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. En ut supérba. p. 978.</l><l xml:id="m-d8028a61-7779-472a-a9c2-de347c99fe02" facs="#m-50ec4633-2f04-4c42-ba59-8656c6ae1b91" label="lyrics-like">V. Memóriam fécit mirabilium suórum miserátor Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-51e515cd-6393-436b-ae5f-562863dfd168" facs="#m-cd36b011-955a-46d2-8d3f-56634eada14e" label="lyrics-like">R. Escam dédit timéntibus se.</l><l xml:id="m-4175edcd-856c-49fa-acb2-df1cec791539" facs="#m-f48f18a9-f980-4b80-8e6d-bc964b303c52" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-4609b0d8-a2a8-4231-8fec-8abf663ad6f7" facs="#m-9628bbff-166b-40c1-9587-2cdf8a8a2c7d" label="ambiguous">Ant. 6.F</l><l xml:id="m-2f431dcb-0d39-4287-974a-cc2b4ad4fc12" facs="#m-2cbab7f8-5ba7-45fe-9e1d-e25a76ba8fe9" label="ambiguous">O</l><l xml:id="m-789e4926-ec53-402d-9d26-e70ea0e9f397" facs="#m-b298409f-4ec2-43ec-9cc2-ea6fd94870b6" label="lyrics-like">Uae mú-li-er “ hábens dráchmas decem, et si</l><l xml:id="m-eeb35c98-04ae-4c5f-8bbf-b7afec32ebaa" facs="#m-877e3623-11e6-4c3f-911c-c1b73e40ad8e" label="lyrics-like">perdíde- rit dráchmam únam, nonne accéndit lu-cér-nam</l><l xml:id="m-ce733c3d-7a39-41a4-a0f7-910f5bad1bab" facs="#m-0abac3db-a828-4bc3-a929-137706a55a28" label="lyrics-like">et evérrit dómum, et quaérit di-ligénter, donec invéni-at?</l><l xml:id="m-8df868c9-a8f4-44e3-b533-cf53c8bb11ff" facs="#m-cce94537-6e2c-477f-9ca5-f31942bb946b" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-0642d3c3-3d21-4cca-91fe-5a04c7cbec9e" facs="#m-15241341-d11f-499b-8fa4-a0437164e01b" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 6. F. p. 211.</l><l xml:id="m-0554445f-b42b-4c77-a4d5-5a47d9ae59a5" facs="#m-4dd037bd-8822-4f5e-a380-9980b0774005" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-7f84b157-0b70-4a3d-b573-788d23291971" facs="#m-71f828c8-5872-431c-8569-8660d533b078" label="lyrics-like">DRotéctor in te sperántium Deus, te duce, sic transeámus per bona</l><l xml:id="m-82cb1948-115f-4119-86b4-54280cd5d0c4" facs="#m-03a6f7f4-ec10-4fc5-a72b-1af903bd2eb1" label="lyrics-like">temporália, “ut non amittámus</l><l xml:id="m-ced3b48c-f720-4b16-a929-59dc23b0b6b8" facs="#m-59725626-3a23-4566-942b-c721f78e1053" label="lyrics-like">sine quo nihil est válidum, ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-b2563beb-9d5e-4a93-b995-639b378bf8de" facs="#m-582ff8cb-4018-49b9-a3ca-f9d51399c259" label="lyrics-like">aetérna. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9e9986b3-cf92-42fc-a217-feefb8359d62" facs="#m-e54f2ef3-dee3-4ea7-912c-ab65bf5be58b" label="lyrics-like">hil sanctum:t multíplica super nos</l><l xml:id="m-192eaa89-4514-4a49-b478-ed0da13d8a57" facs="#m-93e3c43b-faea-414c-9455-5d2e10eaf835" label="lyrics-like">misericórdiam tuam; ut te rectóre,</l><l xml:id="m-e14877ac-c9c5-40c8-8008-1c20b1fb3886" facs="#m-1ec637ad-b87f-4791-bee9-bfe9c5f4fef4" label="lyrics-like">A commemoration is made of the Octave. Ant. Ignem. p. 966. V. Tóllite</l><l xml:id="m-29f2c2a2-03e2-46b2-a5e6-1d5572a47f57" facs="#m-09b337ad-344e-44f8-8547-4502d59c5f2c" label="lyrics-like">júgum. Prayer. Deus, qui nobis in Corde. D.971. However, if the officé</l><l xml:id="m-d736958c-128a-452e-a191-adebbce13678" facs="#m-b5e57649-be0f-4e6b-8fa8-2b55f62413d9" label="lyrics-like">of Monday be not of the Octave of the Sacred Heart, tne Ant. Ad Jésum</l><l xml:id="m-9f332eb0-9259-4799-96a4-fc6f5bb90b5e" facs="#m-d2d17bbb-5e39-4517-8507-278736b025c1" label="text-like">autem. from second Vespers of the Feast, p. 979, is said instead, with the</l><l xml:id="m-82763322-dc42-4b77-a58f-3b0d173129ce" facs="#m-c2b80ad8-f7d7-45ab-9132-78a4c2c47047" label="lyrics-like">v. Hauriétis.</l><l xml:id="m-9eb3a7cf-2a7a-47fb-ad74-451950b6bca0" facs="#m-f8d9db8b-38be-45e2-a12c-37665be35e7e" label="text-like">T Octave of the Feast of the Most Sacred Heart of Jesus.</l><l xml:id="m-5ef55cf3-5b15-4039-984d-5dcd6cf22b2c" facs="#m-67b5ba40-4c0f-4516-be0f-c58afec13c8c" label="text-like">Double major. All as on the Feast, p. 965.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
